※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 3204 LANG_ATTR_NOT_APPLICABLE

※ A list standing alone at the top level with a blank line after it is attached
※ to nothing that follows: it is about the file.  `@[export]` says nothing about a
※ file, so it is refused there; what a file may be said to be is `@[system]`.
@[export]

@[visible]
let shared: u8 = 7u8

let std := ⎕import("std")

@[startup]
fn main(init: std.Init) → u6:
    ⎕narrow(shared, ⌜u6⌝) ?? 0u6
